flowchart TD
    A[Command Input] --> B[Received by Channel Node]
    B --> C[Send Data to Agent Node]
    C --> D{LLM Planning}
    D -->|Complex Command| E[Skill Decomposition]
    D -->|Simple Command| F[Skill Matching]
    E --> G[Execute Skill Manager]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Call Core Node Action]
    H --> I{Safety Check\nGuardrails}
    I -->|Pass| J[Robot Hardware Control]
    I -->|Hazard Detected| K[Emergency Stop / Speed Limit]
